      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a comparison of the floor options for your high-traffic London law firm lobby.\n\n* **Polished Concrete:** Excellent wear resistance and extremely durable, but requires professional sealing and periodic maintenance to prevent etching or staining.\n* **Luxury Vinyl Tile (LVT):** Very water-resistant and relatively easy to maintain with routine sweeping/mopping, offering good resistance to heavy foot traffic.\n* **Natural Stone (Granite/Marble):** Very durable, especially granite, but marble is porous and requires regular sealing to prevent stains and etching from common spills.\n\nFor high traffic, granite offers the best natural durability, whereas LVT provides the lowest long-term maintenance demands.",
